Before changing, deploying, or debugging this project, read and follow `RUNBOOK.md` in the repo root.

Production is Cloudflare Workers (`worker/index.js` + KV), not Express. After HTML/CSS/JS/worker changes run `npm run deploy`. After content.json / specials / PDF source changes intended for live, seed KV or publish via admin. Run `npm run smoke` before calling a production task done.
